Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.85,*Default,,0300,0000,0270,,{\a5\fs35\4c&H000000&\bord0}Raw:  Guchi Jnr @ \NPublic MM Torrents
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.09,0:07:36.22,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Právě teď, půvabná dívko
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.43,0:07:39.27,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Malá, milá dívko
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.49,0:07:42.20,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hledej svou cestu, Honey
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.74,0:07:44.28,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pojď...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.49,0:07:46.62,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pojď, jen na malou chvíli
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.49,0:07:54.47,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prosím, ach prosím nezraň mé city
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.62,0:08:01.17,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mé srdce bije o závod...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.27,0:08:03.50,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,NE! NE! NE!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.50,0:08:05.71,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nehledej mě~
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.53,0:08:08.87,*Default,,0000,0000,0000,,HONEY FLASH!
